  {
    "id": "anno-iwatsuki_upper_p030_right-10",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "穢多非人渡守等無之場主ト相唱ヘ穢多ニ類スル者アリト記録ス其人員未"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "穢多・非人・渡守等はこれ無し。場主と相唱へ、穢多に類する者ありと記録す。その人員は未（詳）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note: there are no eta, hinin, or ferrymen [in this domain]; persons who style themselves bashu (place-keepers) are recorded as belonging to a class akin to eta, and their number is not [stated in detail]. The sentence runs to the foot of the column and finishes with the glyph 詳 at the head of the next column left."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "穢多非人等記載註記（岩崎藩分）"
      }
    ],
